From 96f5ee71357ed69db0de3271bdb85ea2fac64c17 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 08:24:38 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] chronik: native V2 bounded branch, explorer and asset queries

Port of chronik-indexer query/v2_branches.rs, v2_explorer.rs and
v2_assets.rs over abstract sources plus snapshot sources on the v2_index
DB: canonical branch filters with their SHA-256 digest (host SHA-256),
posting merges with continuation cursors, explorer pages (blocks, block
txs, inputs, outputs, witnesses, wire chunks) and asset pages, all with
the Rust limits and error texts. The Rust tests are ported.

Tier: V2
